{"title":"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The probability that event <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> occurs is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />; the probability that event B occurs is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. \nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the probability that both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> occur. The smallest interval necessarily containing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is the interval\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a7397798ff92d0b1d2a3af9e2cd9382aaed49216.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\Big[\\frac{1}{12},\\frac{1}{2}\\Big]\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\Big[\\frac{5}{12},\\frac{1}{2}\\Big]\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\Big[\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{2}{3}\\Big]\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\Big[\\frac{5}{12},\\frac{2}{3}\\Big]\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\Big[\\frac{1}{12},\\frac{2}{3}\\Big]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"597\" height=\"38\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Firstly note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/901e2ed99c0646571a8370d498d65b9af7eb2f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"46\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d385cb353b3bf3d211e83a4154f93845153c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, as clearly the probability that both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> occur cannot be more than the probability that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> alone occurs. The more restrictive condition is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d385cb353b3bf3d211e83a4154f93845153c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5a896e153a5c0e9ffdef2b0c1c25fb2cb458660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3} &lt; \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Furthermore, by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inclusion-Exclusion_Principle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Inclusion-Exclusion Principle\">Inclusion-Exclusion Principle</a>, we also have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/e/8be7b6a38825496d410b978913dc3f5d0bbb9474.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{P}(A&#39; \\wedge B&#39;) = 1 - \\text{P}(A) - \\text{P}(B) + \\text{P}(A \\wedge B) = 1 - \\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{2}{3} + p = p - \\frac{5}{12},\\]\" width=\"480\" height=\"38\" /> and as a probability must be non-negative, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/517afdd81fc21c9d3eb8b4b2c4d1c0f1590d90a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - \\frac{5}{12} \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d4316153e84ebba0e17f061d6e9e28f07d0836f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\geq \\frac{5}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, combining our inequalities gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f11ab1548aaee554d71036b0c8a598b847cca82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{12} \\leq p \\leq \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0220d6c3dbb87245fcdb7b09dea8b66de7af519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} \\Big[\\frac{5}{12},\\frac{2}{3}\\Big]}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"103\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME\" title=\"1983 AHSME\">1983 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1983 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1983\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1983_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1983 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"c